---
// Magnet thank-you. confirm-email redirects here after a become-ai-native-business
// opt-in is confirmed and the book email is sent. noindex (post-confirm utility).
//
// 2026-08-15 (operator): rebuilt as a single forward step to the Flow landing
// page. What changed and why:
//   - The $55 founding-reader bundle card was REMOVED. It was the only surface
//     selling book_bundle_founding (see catalog.ts), so that SKU is now dark by
//     decision, not by accident. The catalog entry stays intact so re-placing it
//     later is a copy change, not a rebuild.
//   - The Proof block was replaced by Flow, the current flagship.
//   - This page deliberately carries NO second capture form. Everyone landing
//     here just confirmed, and waitlist-signup short-circuits an already-confirmed
//     email with "You're already on the list." A form here would read as a dead
//     end and record nothing, so the forward step is a plain link to /flow/.
//   - That also removes the need for the never-built "later welcome email" the
//     old bundle comment promised. No scheduled-send rail is required.
// When Flow ships, this block becomes the "Download Flow" step.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BrandMark from '../../components/ui/BrandMark.astro';
---
<Layout title="Your book is on the way · Orionfold" description="Your free AI Native Business book is on its way to your inbox." noindex>
  <header class="px-6 py-5">
    <!-- Logo + wordmark, top-left, subtle and non-linked (marketing 2026-06-28),
         consistent with the magnet page; the forward action is the Flow CTA. -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 opacity-80" aria-label="Orionfold">
      <BrandMark size={28} class="h-7 w-7" />
      <span class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-none">
        <span class="text-text">Orion</span><span class="text-primary">fold</span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">You're in</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 leading-tight" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 2.6rem);">
      Your book is on the way.
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      Check your inbox for the PDF and EPUB. The links work for seven days, so
      save the files once you grab them.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      You are also on the list for Orionfold Flow. Nothing more to do.
    </p>

    <!-- Single forward step: the flagship. Link only, no capture (see header). -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-primary/25 bg-primary/[0.04] px-6 py-10">
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.23em] text-primary">While you wait</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight">Meet the tool the book is about.</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
        Orionfold Flow is our Mac app for the person doing the work: a place to
        conduct documents with AI agency built in, where you stay the one who
        approves what changes. See the real development build, screen by screen.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/flow/"
        class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-surface transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
        data-astro-prefetch
      >
        Explore Orionfold Flow <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-text-dim">
      Didn't get the email? Check spam, or <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-text-muted" href="/become-ai-native-business/">request it again</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
